name: Seeing Double — club + other X2
author: corpus
description: >-
  Seeing Double gives X2 Mult if the played hand has a scoring Club and a scoring card
  of any other suit. First-shop X2: Smeared Joker makes Clubs/Spades count as the same
  suit, so any non-red card works.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: SeeingDouble
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: SmearedJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: GluttonousJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
  - joker: FlowerPot
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
